@startuml F1.7-D01-listar-solicitacoes
title F1.7-D01 — Listar solicitações
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestsController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre /solicitacoes
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /requests?solicitante=me
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT paginado + filtros
Postgres --> Ctrl: página
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links
note right of WebApp
  Nova solicitação só se
  _links.novaSolicitacao
end note
WebApp --> Aluno: tabela / cards

@enduml
